
=== Aggiungi o togli un dispositivo ===

  1) Aggiungi un router
  2) Aggiungi un host/PC
  3) Aggiungi un server WWW
  4) Aggiungi un server DNS
  5) Togli un dispositivo
  0) Torna indietro

Seleziona (numero): 5

Dispositivi del lab:

  1) as10r1     router AS10  192.168.0.1/30, 110.0.0.1/24
  2) as20r1     router AS20  192.168.0.9/30, 192.168.0.5/30
  3) as30r1     router AS30  192.168.0.13/30, 130.0.0.1/24
  4) as40r1     router AS40  192.168.0.2/30, 192.168.0.6/30, 192.168.0.26/30, 192.168.0.30/30
  5) as50r1     router AS50  192.168.0.18/30, 192.168.0.22/30, 192.168.0.10/30, 192.168.0.14/30
  6) as60r1     router AS60  192.168.0.17/30, 160.0.0.1/24
  7) as70r1     router AS70  192.168.0.25/30, 192.168.0.21/30
  8) as80r1     router AS80  192.168.0.29/30, 180.0.0.1/24

